# Words after a lone year marker ("a finales de enero pasado yo fui") that
# open the next clause, so the marker closes the year phrase before them.
# Subject pronouns and unstressed object pronouns (pronombres átonos). Source:
# RAE and ASALE, Nueva gramática de la lengua española (2009), the chapter on
# personal pronouns. "la" is also an article. "el" is left out: "pasado el
# plazo" is "past the deadline", and the marker is then left over.
yo
tú
él
ella
nosotros
se
me
te
lo
la
le
les
